prompt: "Target file: lmrs/gateway.py\nOperation: modify_file\n\nMRS excerpt:\n- C-002
  Provider Gateway Integration: LMRS appears to model_access_core as a local provider
  backend and returns responses normalizable into canonical provider responses.\n\
  - C-004 Canonical Chat Request: the gateway request contract also fixes normalized
  response expectations for local provider routing.\n\nCurrent full content of lmrs/gateway.py
  before this modification:\n```python\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nfrom
  dataclasses import dataclass, field\nfrom typing import Any, Mapping\n\n\n@dataclass(frozen=True)\n\
  class ChatMessage:\n    \"\"\"One role-tagged message from a canonical gateway chat
  request.\"\"\"\n\n    role: str\n    content: str | list[Mapping[str, Any]]\n  \
  \  name: str | None = None\n    metadata: Mapping[str, Any] = field(default_factory=dict)\n\
  \n\n@dataclass(frozen=True)\nclass CanonicalChatRequest:\n    \"\"\"Gateway-owned
  request accepted by LMRS for local model routing.\"\"\"\n\n    session_id: str\n\
  \    request_id: str\n    model_name: str\n    messages: tuple[ChatMessage, ...]\n\
  \    tools: tuple[Mapping[str, Any], ...] = ()\n    reserved_output_tokens: int
  = 0\n    options: Mapping[str, Any] = field(default_factory=dict)\n```\n\nModify
  the file by adding the following dataclass after CanonicalChatRequest:\n\n```python\n\
  \n@dataclass(frozen=True)\nclass LocalProviderResponse:\n    \"\"\"Normalized LMRS
  response shape returned to the provider gateway.\"\"\"\n\n    request_id: str\n\
  \    status: str\n    message: ChatMessage | None = None\n    usage: Mapping[str,
  Any] = field(default_factory=dict)\n    reason_code: str | None = None\n    runtime_metadata:
  Mapping[str, Any] = field(default_factory=dict)\n    telemetry: Mapping[str, Any]
  = field(default_factory=dict)\n```\n\nConstraints:\n- Keep existing classes unchanged.\n\
  - Use the existing imports; do not add new imports.\n- The dataclass must be frozen.\n\
  - Do not add validation or normalization functions in this step."
verification:
  type: static_analysis
  target: lmrs/gateway.py::LocalProviderResponse
  expected: The file defines a frozen LocalProviderResponse dataclass carrying 
    status, optional assistant message, usage, reason code, runtime metadata, 
    and telemetry.
